New files: everything else (src/qnn.ts, src/quantumViews.ts, src/scenes.ts, src/search.ts,
src/quantum/, scripts/, tests/, serve.mjs, favicon.png, README.md, DEVLOG.md).

At build time, dist/project/ receives artwork and trained models from the sibling
bus-search-lab and waldo-search-lab folders of this repository (MIT, original
artwork); src/scenes.ts and src/search.ts import their feature and Grover code.
Google Analytics calls, regression, regularization and the tutorial loader are removed.
